T1  - Artificial intelligence affordances in Brazilian higher education: supporting the sustainable development goals
AU  - Mello Cavalcanti, Wania
AU  - Tavares, Elaine Maria
JO  - International Journal of Educational Management
VL  - 40
IS  - 1
SP  - 319
EP  - 335
