T1  - Exploring self-learning efficacy: a comparative analysis of ChatGPT and Gemini
AU  - Colaco, Daniella Maria
AU  - Antao, Delia
JO  - Interactive Technology and Smart Education
VL  - 22
IS  - 4
SP  - 688
EP  - 698
