T1  - Generative AI in teaching: How AI literacy and AI-generated lesson design shape teachers’ classroom implementation strategies
AU  - Dahri, Nisar Ahmed
AU  - Hussain, Akhtar
AU  - Amjad, Amjad Islam
AU  - Fauadi, Muhammad Hafidz Fazli Bin Md
