T1  - Stress and burnout in university students with ADHD-like symptoms: The role of memory bias and daily stress
AU  - Erdal, Kerstin
AU  - Adami, Gordon
AU  - Gelléri, Petra
AU  - Dettmers, Jan
JO  - International Journal of Educational Research Open
VL  - 9
SP  - 100497
